{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1CO","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"哥林多前書","commonName":"哥林多前書","title":"哥林多前書","order":46,"numberOfChapters":16,"sha256":"0bb2df52ecc035daf061ff19f8f15532627b064d54d80c5599126c0ead143f8d","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1CO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":16,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1CO/16.json","totalNumberOfVerses":437},"chapter":{"number":5,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["判斷淫亂的事件"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["風聞在你們中間有淫亂的事。這樣的淫亂連外邦人中也沒有，就是有人收了他的繼母。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["你們還是自高自大，並不哀痛，把行這事的人從你們中間趕出去。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["我身子雖不在你們那裏，心卻在你們那裏，好像我親自與你們同在，已經判斷了行這事的人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["就是你們聚會的時候，我的心也同在。奉我們主耶穌的名，並用我們主耶穌的權能，"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["要把這樣的人交給撒但，敗壞他的肉體，使他的靈魂在主耶穌的日子可以得救。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["你們這自誇是不好的。豈不知一點麵酵能使全團發起來嗎？"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["你們既是無酵的麵，應當把舊酵除淨，好使你們成為新團；因為我們逾越節的羔羊基督已經被殺獻祭了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["所以，我們守這節不可用舊酵，也不可用惡毒",{"noteId":1},"、邪惡的酵，只用誠實真正的無酵餅。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["我先前寫信給你們說，不可與淫亂的人相交。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["此話不是指這世上一概行淫亂的，或貪婪的，勒索的，或拜偶像的；若是這樣，你們除非離開世界方可。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["但如今我寫信給你們說，若有稱為弟兄是行淫亂的，或貪婪的，或拜偶像的，或辱罵的，或醉酒的，或勒索的，這樣的人不可與他相交，就是與他吃飯都不可。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["因為審判教外的人與我何干？教內的人豈不是你們審判的嗎？"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["至於外人有上帝審判他們。你們應當把那惡人從你們中間趕出去。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":1,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：陰毒","reference":{"chapter":5,"verse":8}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1CO/5.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1CO/6.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1CO/4.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}